          "description": "<section class=\"about-product dark-bg\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"about-product__inner\">\n<div class=\"about-product__image\">\n<div class=\"about-product__img\"><img src=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-glqkoqulcz/images/stencil/original/image-manager/studio-plus-sampler.png?t=1779478889\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1592\" /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-product__content\">\n<p class=\"sub-heading\">Studio Plus Sampler Pack</p>\n<h2 class=\"page-heading\">A Lil' Dab Will Do</h2>\n<p>Studio Plus was developed by popular demand, with artists wanting to find a vibrancy- and opacity-packed line offered at a value. Featuring (18) intermixable, core colors that are designed to fire true from 06-6 and (6) specialty colors that are uniquely able to deliver mottling magic at low-fire temps (Cone 06/05), this line is sure to become a fan favorite in pro and community studios alike! Packed with addition value, this pack is a GREAT way to test a wide range of this new studio favorite without breaking the bank!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
